INSERT INTO `litemall_brand` VALUES (1001000,'MUJI Manufacturer','Carefully selected MUJI manufacturers and production raw materials,\nWith almost zero profit price, excluding the brand premium,\nLet users enjoy the quality life of the original brand.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/1541445967645114dd75f6b0edc4762d.png',2,12.90,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2026-08-09 21:31:41',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001002,'infield manufacturer','We carefully select towels from all over the world, and finally choose a factory that OEMs for Uchino in Japan, pursuing the softness and functionality of the towels.The quality is comparable to towels worth several hundred yuan in the mall.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/8ca3ce091504f8aa1fba3fdbb7a6e351.png',10,29.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001003,'AdidasManufacturer','Carefully selected manufacturers for Adidas and other brands,\nSelect high-quality raw materials and design together with the factory,\nTo provide you with the best and ideal sports equipment.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/335334d0deaff6dc3376334822ab3a2f.png',30,49.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001007,'UNIQLO Manufacturer','We carefully selected the famous Japanese clothing manufacturer UNIQLO.\nSelect high-quality long-staple cotton and combing technology,\nDesigned together with the factory to provide you with ideal cotton socks.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/0d72832e37e7e3ea391b519abbbc95a3.png',12,29.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001008,'Thermos manufacturer','Yanxuan went deep into the insulation industry,\nFind the OEM of the German thermostat manufacturer.\nSame quality, but better price.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/5fd51e29b9459dae7df8040c8219f241.png',40,45.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001010,'starbucks manufacturer','Carefully selected and searched for thermos cup manufacturing companies across the country.\nFinally found the manufacturer of high-end coffee brand Starbucks,\nFocused on the production of thermos cups for 20 years, with both quality and appearance.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/5668bc50f2f2e551891044525710dc84.png',34,39.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001012,'Wedgwood Manufacturers','Carefully selected and visited the Wedgwood manufacturer of ceramics used by the British royal family.\nFrom mold making to finished product, it has gone through 25 processes, 7 inspections, and 3 firings.\nEven where you can’t see, we are persisting.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/68940e8e23f96dbeb3548d943d83d5e4.png',21,39.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001013,'Royal DoultonManufacturers','Carefully selected and in-depth manufacturer of Royal Doulton, the largest bone china brand in the UK,\nSynonymous with top-quality British porcelain, it is widely loved by royal families around the world.\nEvery piece of porcelain has its own story.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/0de643a02043fd9680b11e21c452adaa.png',47,24.90,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001015,'Japanese KEYUCA manufacturer','KEYUCA is a Japanese tableware and cooking utensils brand.\nFollow the minimalist log style and have a high-end tableware experience.\nThe carefully selected tableware comes from this brand of manufacturer.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/9b85b45f23da558be101dbcc273b1d6d.png',49,14.90,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001016,'admiration maker','150 samples were compared and screened, and 20 factories were visited in depth.\nCarefully selected high-end lingerie manufacturers,\n20-year quality guarantee to create natural and comfortable clothing for you.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/5104f84110eac111968c63c18ebd62c0.png',9,35.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001020,'Ralph LaurenManufacturer','We have successfully contacted the manufacturer of Ralph Lauren Home, mastered advanced production equipment, and inherited brand technology and processes.If you pursue quality of life, you deserve it.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/9df78eb751eae2546bd3ee7e61c9b854.png',20,29.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001037,'Samsonite Manufacturer','Carefully selected bags with both quality and appearance.\nSelect manufacturers to cooperate with brands such as Samsonite, CK, and Ricardo,\nIt has more than 20 domestic advanced assembly lines, and its strength guarantees quality.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/80dce660938931956ee9a3a2b111bd37.jpg',5,59.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001038,'Coach manufacturer','Carefully selected to produce high-quality, high-looking leather accessories.\nProduced by brand manufacturers such as Coach and MK,\nIt is strictly supervised by 360-degree producers to bring you high-quality leather goods.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/1b1cc16135fd8467d40983f75f644127.png',3,49.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001039,'MK manufacturer','Carefully selected to manufacture high-quality leather goods,\nChoose the manufacturing factory that Michael Kors brand cooperates with,\n18 years of professional leather goods production experience, exquisite craftsmanship and quality assurance.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/fc9cd1309374f7707855de80522fb310.jpg',17,79.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1001045,'Rollei Manufacturer','Our team set out to craft a breathable, soft silk quilt - from cocoon raw material to thermal performance, tested and refined through multiple selections. Made by the Rollei manufacturer, hand-finished for premium comfort.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/14122a41a4985d23e1a172302ee818e9.png',45,699.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1003000,'CartersManufacturer','Produced by Carters big-name foundry,\nStrictly selected pure natural materials, no fluorescence and no additives.\nThe ITS safety mark is authoritatively inspected and safely escorted.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/efe9131599ced0297213e6ec67eb2174.png',41,19.90,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1005001,'GoodyManufacturer','Carefully selected manufacturers of Goody, a century-old hair accessories brand in the United States,\nMake sure each comb is made with exquisite workmanship and protects your scalp.\nPrincess Diana\'s favorite, you can have it too.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/7c918f37de108f3687d69b39daab34eb.png',48,39.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1006000,'Versace manufacturer','We carefully select the manufacturer of the Italian luxury brand Versace.\nCommitted to bringing users exquisite, elegant and fashionable leather bags,\nInherit unique beauty and experience quality life.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/c80ae035387495a61a4515906205efff.png',18,99.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1008000,'WPC manufacturer','Strictly looking for Japanese umbrella brand W.P.C manufacturers,\nUsing rigorous craftsmanship and environmentally friendly materials,\nAccumulating 15 years of industry experience to create exquisite rain gear.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/c4e97cc87186ce17f9316f3ba39e220c.png',22,59.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1010001,'Zhu Baotang Manufacturer','Yanxuan visited brush-making bases in Hebei, Anhui and other areas,\nSelected manufacturers of brands such as Zhubaotang and Sephora,\nStrictly control production and quality inspection, and pursue a beautiful life with you.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/61b0b7ae4f0163422009defbceaa41ad.jpg',39,29.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1010002,'shiseido manufacturer','Discovering beauty and becoming beautiful is a woman’s lifelong pursuit.\nWe carefully select Shiseido OEM factories to create natural beauty products.\nCommitted to bringing more beautiful experiences and enjoyment.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/5449236b80d1e678dedee2f626cd67c4.png',19,29.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1015000,'NITORI Manufacturer','Pets are the most affectionate companions of human beings.\nWe carefully select and search for the manufacturer of NITORI, the largest home furnishing brand in Japan.\nEvery footprint is to better care for your TA','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/6f3d310601b18610553c675e0e14d107.png',43,69.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1016002,'HUGO BOSSManufacturer','Carefully selected manufacturers of HUGO BOSS, a well-known German luxury product,\nDevelop light luxury quality home clothes such as pajamas, nightgowns, and casual pants.\nI hope you feel elegant and sophisticated every day at home.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/70ada9877b2efa82227437af3231fe50.png',11,45.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1018000,'Sperry Manufacturer','We compared vulcanized-shoe makers and visited multiple factories before choosing the Sperry brand manufacturer - a comfortable, well-shaped pair of high-quality canvas shoes.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/2eb12d84037346441088267432da31c4.png',32,199.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1021000,'Marc Jacobs Manufacturer','We sought out the manufacturer behind the design brand Marc Jacobs: strict material selection and refined weaving details bring you elegant, premium accessories.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/c8dac4eb1a458d778420ba520edab3d0.png',24,69.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1022000,'UGG manufacturer','Looking for high-quality fur integrated snow boots?\nWe carefully visited several snow boot manufacturers to compare their craftsmanship.\nSelect UGG-approved foundries just for elegance and comfort.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/4d2a3dea7e0172ae48e8161f04cfa045.jpg',29,59.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1022001,'Palladium Manufacturers','We carefully visited many major shoe manufacturers and selected the Palladium manufacturer.\nCompare craftsmanship and material selection to find the shoemaking formula that has been passed down for many years.\nJust to make a high-quality casual shoe.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/3480f2a4026c60eb4921f0aa3facbde8.png',31,249.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1023000,'PetitBateau Sailboat Maker','In order to create baby clothing suitable for babies,\nThe carefully selected team is looking for the brand manufacturer of PetitBateau small sailboat,\nNo fluorescent agent, national Class A standard, so your baby can wear it with confidence.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/1a11438598f1bb52b1741e123b523cb5.jpg',25,36.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1024000,'WMF Manufacturer','We searched for the manufacturer of WMF, Germany\'s century-old premium kitchenware, and chose a stainless-steel factory with 14 years of experience - quality cookware that gets more done.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/2018e9ac91ec37d9aaf437a1fd5d7070.png',8,9.90,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1024001,'OBH Manufacturer','Carefully select manufacturers looking for the OBH brand to create exquisite kitchenware.\nMade in a Korean-owned factory, strict quality inspection, quality carving\nStrive to bring consumers a new cooking experience.','http://yanxuan.nosdn.127.net/bf3499ac17a11ffb9bb7caa47ebef2dd.png',42,39.00,'2018-02-01 00:00:00','2018-02-01 00:00:00',0,'manual',NULL,0,1),(1024003,'Stoneline Manufacturer','We carefully select the manufacturer of the classic German brand Stoneline.\nTrack the craftsmanship, consider the details, and try it yourself,\nWe select the most suitable pots and ceramic knives for you and