c82-5d7bbd183976.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/d571ccb1-4860-4e23-a8ee-682d9c62e257.jpg\"]','2026-07-16 10:35:03','\n <p> Hands-Free Bladeless Neck Fan – 360° Surrounding Cool Breeze</p>\n <p>Stay cool, comfortable, and hands-free wherever you go with our Portable Bladeless Neck Fan. Designed to look like a sleek pair of headphones, this wearable personal fan slips comfortably around your neck to deliver a refreshing 360-degree surrounding breeze without the hassle of spinning blades. Perfect for hot summer commutes, outdoor workouts, cooking, gardening, or camping, it features an upgraded twin-turbine motor and multiple speed levels to instantly lower your body temperature. With a high-capacity rechargeable battery and an ultra-lightweight, ergonomic design, it provides quiet, safe, and long-lasting cooling relief all day long.</p>\n <p> Key Features</p>\n <p>Safe Bladeless Design: Designed without traditional spinning fan blades, making it perfectly safe for children and seniors, and eliminating the risk of hair getting caught.</p>\n <p>360° Surrounding Airflow: Engineered with multi-vent air outlets around the band to provide a consistent, wrapping breeze that cools your neck and face simultaneously.</p>\n <p>Adjustable Multi-Speed Modes: Easily toggle between multiple wind speed settings (low, medium, high) with a single button to match your personal comfort level.</p>\n <p>USB Rechargeable &amp; Long Battery Life: Built-in high-capacity lithium battery easily recharges via Type-C USB and delivers hours of continuous cooling on a single charge.</p>\n <p>Ultra-Quiet &amp; Lightweight Comfort: Features a low-noise brushless motor that operates quietly in the background, paired with a lightweight frame that won\'t strain your neck during extended wear.</p>\n <p> Product Specifications</p>\n <p>Product Type: Wearable Bladeless Neck Fan</p>\n <p>Charging Method: Type-C USB Cable</p>\n <p>Speed Settings: Multiple Adjustable Wind Speeds</p>\n <p>Design Type: Sa