he interior, exterior, wheels, dashboard, seat crevices, wheel spokes, air vents, rim surfaces, speaker surfaces, etc.</em><br></p>\n <p><em>PRACTICAL DESIGN: The brush handles have a smooth surface, making them very comfortable to hold. The end of the handle has a hole so you can hang the brushes on the wall after use. This makes it easy to use the brushes the next time and also saves space.</em><br></p>\n <p><em>WHAT YOU GET: The brush set includes 6 brushes in various sizes, 3 wire brushes, 1 car wash mitt, 1 3-finger slat cleaner, and 2 sponge cloths. Whether you’re cleaning dust and other small particles from wheels or air vents, the various brushes and sizes will meet your needs.</em><br></p>\n <p><em>Perfect for Cleaning: The brushes can be used efficiently for wet or dry cleaning—with water or soapy water, or for stubborn dirt. Your car will look beautiful and clean, just like new. The elastic wrist strap also helps prevent the brush from slipping off your hand.</em><br></p>\n <p><em>HIGH-QUALITY AND DURABLE: These car brushes are made of bristles and wood, steel wire and rubber, extra-fine fibers, and nylon. The bristles are soft and gentle, very flexible and durable, and won’t scratch your wheels or leather seat covers.</em><br></p>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17833824/48f93803-265a-417e-8dc9-bff818d4c565.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n <br>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17833824/a14609f8-6a02-4e36-8d16-5fdae33b3039.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n <br>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17833824/c6f4647b-9e24-414a-8637-7d7db0cf1737.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n <br>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17833824/300ebaed-0f15-4bfd-9f5c-c0eed821b82e.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n <br>\n <img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/17833824/aa1a7374-0e87-4d32-88c9-5124166a2e0a.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%