res</p>\n <p>Safe Bladeless Design: Designed without traditional spinning fan blades, making it perfectly safe for children and seniors, and eliminating the risk of hair getting caught.</p>\n <p>360° Surrounding Airflow: Engineered with multi-vent air outlets around the band to provide a consistent, wrapping breeze that cools your neck and face simultaneously.</p>\n <p>Adjustable Multi-Speed Modes: Easily toggle between multiple wind speed settings (low, medium, high) with a single button to match your personal comfort level.</p>\n <p>USB Rechargeable &amp; Long Battery Life: Built-in high-capacity lithium battery easily recharges via Type-C USB and delivers hours of continuous cooling on a single charge.</p>\n <p>Ultra-Quiet &amp; Lightweight Comfort: Features a low-noise brushless motor that operates quietly in the background, paired with a lightweight frame that won\'t strain your neck during extended wear.</p>\n <p> Product Specifications</p>\n <p>Product Type: Wearable Bladeless Neck Fan</p>\n <p>Charging Method: Type-C USB Cable</p>\n <p>Speed Settings: Multiple Adjustable Wind Speeds</p>\n <p>Design Type: Safe Bladeless &amp; Ergonomic Headphone Style</p>\n <p>Application: Outdoor Travel, Office, Gym, Garde</p>\n <p>ning, Camping</p>\n','2026-07-15 12:47:23','2026-08-10 03:00:03',0,'cj','2077016924779986946',0,0,0.0,NULL),(10009045,'cj_2077091747707240449','20000mAh Camping Fan With LED Lantern 8 Speed Desk Fan With Remote Portable Outdoor Fan With Hook For Tent Power Outages Jobsit',1036519,0,'[]','20000mAh Camping Fan With LED Lantern 8 Speed Desk Fan With Remote Portable Outdoor Fan With Hook For Tent Power Outages Jobsite','20000mAh Camping Fan With LED Lantern 8 Speed Desk Fan With Remote Portable Outdoor Fan With Hook For Tent Power Outages Jobsite',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/60532d75-6c4f-450b-8cfc-aa482865fa1a.png','',0,0,'',403.06,403.06,0.00,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,0,'','',0,0,0.00,0.00,0,NULL,'2026-07-15 12:47:23','2026-08-10 03:00:51',0,