-10 03:00:46',0,'cj','2605280343261629300',0,0,0.0,NULL),(10009327,'cj_2607160701271609700','Solar-Powered Parrot Craft Lawn Lamp',1036503,0,'[]','Solar-Powered Parrot Craft Lawn Lamp','<p><img src=\"https://oss-cf.cjdropshipping.com/product/2026/07/16/07/3dccb58e-b39f-4ab4-b2e4-637c63fea907.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"/><img src=\"https://oss-cf.cjdropshipping.com/product/2026/07/16/07/d36bcf6a-e343-494d-94e2-4ef7c',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/quick/product/a4911280-afd5-48cc-ac02-676aa2327e6e.jpg','',0,0,'',37.87,37.87,0.00,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,0,'','',0,0,0.00,0.00,0,NULL,'2026-07-16 13:45:57','2026-08-10 03:00:03',0,'cj','2607160701271609700',0,0,0.0,NULL),(10009328,'cj_2077320534144438273','Double-head S-hook Stainless Steel S-shaped Hook, Solid Load-bearing Double-hook For Kitchen Storage And Storage, Bathroom Hook',1036505,0,'[\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/a212050d-c648-4d49-a4a3-2dd7a99f7d19.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/a7a0a441-ebd0-4459-b690-62076c39d50a.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/792e9eb7-da37-4de7-8171-d45fc07748fa.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/4b3b40f2-f1a3-42e9-96c4-baa3e2b19d94.jpg\"]','Double-head S-hook Stainless Steel S-shaped Hook, Solid Load-bearing Double-hook For Kitchen Storage And Storage, Bathroom Hook','Double-head S-hook Stainless Steel S-shaped Hook, Solid Load-bearing Double-hook For Kitchen Storage And Storage, Bathroom Hook',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/a212050d-c648-4d49-a4a3-2dd7a99f7d19.jpg','',0,0,'',41.47,41.47,0.00,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,0,'','',0,0,0.00,0.00,0,'\n <p>Stainless Steel Double S-Hook Product Description</p>\n <p><strong>Stainless Steel Double S-Hook</strong> This heavy-duty dual-end S-shaped hook is made of premium solid stainless steel, featuring sturdy load-bearing capacity, rust-proof and durable performance. Adopting integrated solid molding process, the double-head hook design realizes dual-point hanging storage, which greatly improves space utilization. It is a practical multi-functional hanging accessory widely suitable for kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, closet and various home storage scenarios, perfect for daily household organization and item sorting.</p>\n <p><strong> Solid Stainless Steel Material &amp; Durable</strong> Made of high-quality solid stainless steel, the hook features thickened body, high hardness and strong toughness. Different from thin hollow hooks, this solid S-hook is not easy to bend, deform or break under heavy load. It has excellent wear resistance, corrosion resistance and oxidation resistance, maintaining a smooth and brand-new appearance for long-term indoor and humid environment use, with super long service life.</p>\n <p><strong> Heavy Load-bearing &amp; Stable Hanging</strong> With scientific S-shaped curved design and integrated one-piece molding, the double-head hook has uniform force and stable bearing capacity. The smooth arc bayonet can firmly clamp hanging objects without slipping or falling off. It supports heavy-duty hanging of various daily items, effectively solving the problem of unstable hanging and poor load-bearing of ordinary thin hooks.</p>\n <p><strong> Double-head Dual-use &amp; Space-saving</strong> The unique double-sided S-shaped structure realizes one hook with double hanging functions. One end can be hung on rods, shelves, cabinet edges and crossbars, and the other end can hang various daily supplies. It makes full use of vertical blank space, avoids messy desktop and stacked items, effectively optimizes home storage and keeps the living environment neat and tidy.</p>\n <p><strong> Smooth Polished Surface &amp; No Scratches</strong> Adopting fine mirror polishing process, the hook surface is smooth and burr-free with rounded edges. It will not scratch your hands, clothes, bags or hanging items during use. The sleek polished finish is easy to clean, just wipe with a rag to remove dust and stains, convenient for daily maintenance.</p>\n <p><strong> Multi-scene Universal Household Hook</strong> This versatile S-hook fits various scenarios perfectly. It can be used as kitchen storage hook for hanging spoons, shovels, pot covers, utensils and kitchen gadgets; as bathroom hook for hanging towels, bath balls, robes and toiletries; also suitable for hanging clothes, hats, bags, tools and other items in cloakrooms, balconies and workshops.</p>\n <p><strong> Tool-free Installation &amp; Reusable</strong> No drilling, no screws and no glue required, the hook can be freely hung and removed at will, realizing zero-damage installation. It can be disassembled and reused anytime, flexible to adjust the hanging position according to your needs, convenient and labor-saving for daily household storage and finishing.<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/289562c6-2bbc-4259-a376-2be6e05b7347.jpg\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"font-size: 13px; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/8859ad78-ded8-45ec-ab43-05c6c6fcec49.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/5277fb40-6c75-4358-af1f-504348b70cab.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/6754ac71-7872-496b-bb3a-ea0ce1242838.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></p>\n','2026-07-16 13:45:57','2026-08-10 03:00:04',0,'cj','2077320534144438273',0,0,0.0,NULL),(10009329,'cj_2077326100517281794','LED Solar Copper Wire Lights, Fairy Color Lights, Courtyard Decoration Atmosphere Lights, Outdoor Waterproof Copper Wire Lights',1036503,0,'[]','LED Solar Copper Wire Lights, Fairy Color Lights, Courtyard Decoration Atmosphere Lights, Outdoor Waterproof Copper Wire Lights, String Lights','LED Solar Copper Wire Lights, Fairy Color Lights, Courtyard Decoration Atmosphere Lights, Outdoor Waterproof Copper Wire Lights, String Lights',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/8ce89f44-ee10-41e7-8d84-8bac17e5f078.jpg','',0,0,'',119.52,119.5