an   6 Speed Silent Desk Fan With Humidifier, Timer & Colourful Lights, USB Mini Air Conditioner','Portable Bladeless Air Cooler Fan   6 Speed Silent Desk Fan With Humidifier, Timer & Colourful Lights, USB Mini Air Conditioner',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/66dd8166-cb25-462d-bc37-073c3e515055.jpg','',0,0,'',254.88,254.88,0.00,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,0,'','',0,0,0.00,0.00,0,NULL,'2026-07-16 13:45:57','2026-08-10 03:00:03',0,'cj','2077583157631160322',0,0,0.0,NULL),(10009334,'cj_2077648859226210305','EVA Sheet Material, Anti-static And Flame-retardant Eva Sponge, Anti-static EVA Material',1036505,0,'[\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/5f0291ed-4301-4b14-9703-c0065692253f.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/cc6db9e0-0a04-4251-8bb1-6ed1edc740e3.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/2590416f-371b-4754-9794-299a66278352.jpg\",\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/efeb42d8-adcb-4245-a24b-774d60009493.png\"]','EVA Sheet Material, Anti-static And Flame-retardant Eva Sponge, Anti-static EVA Material','EVA Sheet Material, Anti-static And Flame-retardant Eva Sponge, Anti-static EVA Material',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/5f0291ed-4301-4b14-9703-c0065692253f.jpg','',0,0,'',191.52,191.52,0.00,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,0,'','',0,0,0.00,0.00,0,'\n <h1>Self-adhesive EVA Foam Roll Product Description</h1>\n <h2>Product Overview</h2>\n <p>This EVA foam roll is made of high-quality EVA material, available in rolls and sheets. It features anti-static and flame retardant properties, with uniform foam structure and stable performance. Equipped with self-adhesive backing for easy installation. Widely used for packaging cushioning, shock absorption, sealing, electronics protection, industrial lining and many other industrial applications. Custom sizes and thicknesses are supported.</p>\n <h2>Key Features</h2>\n <h3>1. Anti-static &amp; Flame Retardant Performance</h3>\n <p>Special material formula effectively prevents static buildup and meets flame retardant requirements. Ideal for electronic component packaging to avoid static damage to precision parts.</p>\n <h3>2. Excellent Shock Absorption &amp; Cushioning</h3>\n <p>Good flexibility and compression resistance. Provides reliable buffer protection against collision and extrusion during transportation and use.</p>\n <h3>3. Self-adhesive Backing &amp; Easy Processing</h3>\n <p>Comes with strong adhesive layer for convenient pasting. Can be cut into any shape and size, suitable for customized processing to match various usage scenarios.</p>\n <h3>4. Wide Industrial Application</h3>\n <p>Applicable to electronic factories, hardware packaging, machinery sealing, logistics shockproof packaging, instrument lining and other fields. Custom specifications are acceptable for bulk orders.<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/846c97b7-ec1a-4ffe-9196-54d5c171c576.png\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"font-size: 13px; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/928ecdfb-f7f1-4ba6-ae36-f3acba2b56f4.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/16568244-04ab-4f06-a80c-e22d64149223.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/ccbf4702-182d-41ad-beb8-f073690ef794.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></p>\n','2026-07-16 13:45:57','2026-08-10 03:00:05',0,'cj','2077648859226210305',0,0,0.0,NULL),(10009335,'cj_2077657705867116545','Screwdriver Set, 10 Pcs Set With Handle Screwdrivers And 2 Portable Screwdriver Bits, Including Flathead 5mm, 6mm, And Phillips',1036510,0,'[]','Screwdriver Set, 10 Pcs Set With Handle Screwdrivers And 2 Portable Screwdriver Bits, Including Flathead 5mm, 6mm, And Phillips PH0, PH1, PH2 Bits, Suitable For Home Repairs','Screwdriver Set, 10 Pcs Set With Handle Screwdrivers And 2 Portable Screwdriver Bits, Including Flathead 5mm, 6mm, And Phillips PH0, PH1, PH2 Bits, Suitable For Home Repairs',1,100,'https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/ffba977d-d88d-4